Lughnasadh NEWS — history of user-visible changes
=================================================

* Version 0.4.0 (Fourth Harvest) — 27.09.2026
  Fix: promotion moves were printed with the wrong letter (queen came out as
  a null byte, knight as "b", bishop as "r", rook as "q").
  Fix: "go" now runs on a search thread, so "stop" and "go infinite" work.
  New: "go nodes N" limit.
  Eval: isolated/doubled pawns, rooks on open files, passed pawns with king
  distance and free path, rule of the square in pawn endings, drawish-material
  scaling (bare minor, minor + pawn vs pawns, opposite bishops).
  Search: dynamic contempt, so the better side avoids repetitions.

* Version 0.3.0 (Third Harvest)
  Aspiration windows, check extension, bishop-pair evaluation.
  Documentation tree aligned with free-software / GNU-style layout.

* Version 0.2.0 (Second Harvest)
  Bitboards, iterative deepening, TT, null-move, LMR, quiescence, tapered eval.

* Version 0.1.0 (First Harvest)
  Initial UCI classical engine for study and prep.
